Ramsey looked up at the school building. "Good

27
00:02:14.608 --> 00:02:20.039
grief," he muttered. "What is this dark and sinister place?" "I

28
00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:24.449
heard it's where the monsters go to school," Margaret Oh said. Rebecca

29
